# Naturinfo production context

Before any Naturinfo project change, read `docs/naturinfo/START-HERE.md`. It is the mandatory entry point. Then read the detailed document it names for the task. Those documents stay canonical for their subjects.

If those documents disagree with `/design`, follow the documents.

If the documents are silent, do not invent a product rule. Ask, or leave the gap explicit.

`/design` is read-only. See the design rule.
